# Backend rules

Before planning or implementing backend work, read:
- `spec/00-shared-architecture-directives.md`
- `spec/05-backend-architecture-directives.md`

## Layering (strict)

Entry (routes/controllers) → Service → Repository. No controller → repository shortcuts. No HTTP objects in service/repository layers.

## Defaults

- Node.js 24, native ESM, Zod at boundaries, Vitest for tests.
- Validate env at startup; never hardcode secrets.
- Prefer Fastify injection for integration tests.

## Tests

Follow `spec/07-monorepo-testing-strategy.md`. State layer (unit/integration/contract) and what is mocked.
